          "start": 5.88,
          "end": 9.88,
          "relative_start": 5.88,
          "relative_end": 9.88,
          "en": "Was the goal to reinvent the business model? Certainly. That's the goal.",
          "zh": "目标是重塑商业模式吗？当然，这就是目标。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "重塑商业模式"
