          "en_highlights": [
            "reinvent the business model"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "start": 9.88,
          "end": 18.88,
          "relative_start": 9.88,
          "relative_end": 18.88,
          "en": "Like, I think, you know, most small, independent magazine businesses are folding because they're not thinking outside the box.",
          "zh": "我认为大多数小型独立杂志倒闭是因为它们没有跳出框框思考。",
