        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "start": 18.88,
          "end": 23.38,
          "relative_start": 18.88,
          "relative_end": 23.38,
          "en": "Time is up, yes, yes. There's so much going on, how can you fight for people's attention?",
          "zh": "时间到了，是的。有这么多事情发生，你如何争夺人们的注意力？",
          "zh_highlights": [
