          "zh_highlights": [
            "很多身份"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "many things"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 7,
          "start": 31.25,
          "end": 41.25,
          "relative_start": 31.25,
          "relative_end": 41.25,
          "en": "But let's start with Supermodel. A businesswoman, I invest in companies and ideas and people I believe in.",
          "zh": "但首先，她是超模、商人，我**于我相信的公司、创意和人。",
          "zh_highlights": [
