            "businesswoman"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 8,
          "start": 41.25,
          "end": 47.75,
          "relative_start": 41.25,
          "relative_end": 47.75,
          "en": "Money is power. And she's in the headlines, whether she wants them or not.",
          "zh": "金钱就是力量。无论她是否愿意，她总是登上头条。",
          "zh_highlights": [
